/demo/output/
*.mp4
*.gif

# Trailing-slash patterns above are paired with slashless twins so that a
# symlinked dependency or dataset is ignored too.

# NOTE: *.csv / *.tsv are deliberately NOT ignored. The downstream navigation
# statistics read per_episode_metrics.csv, which a global rule would swallow.
